{
  "_note": "账号支路的来源与边界声明(2026-08-27 补:zone.xpage 自 e1c1300 起就引用本文件,但它从未被创建,详情页脚注一直静默渲空)。与首页 p-foot 是两回事:那段讲的是公开状态页,这页三张卡走的是 GraphQL Analytics + 用户自带只读令牌。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "t",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.zfoot}",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "lineSpacing": "4pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "5"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "zfoot": "「今日流量 / 缓存效果 / 请求趋势」的数据来自 Cloudflare GraphQL Analytics 接口，由这台设备用你配置的只读令牌直接请求；令牌保存在本机，不随包上传。删除令牌后这些组件会回到未接入态。"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "zfoot": "Traffic, cache and trend data come from the Cloudflare GraphQL Analytics API, fetched directly from this device with your read-only token. The token is sent only to Cloudflare. Remove it and these widgets fall back to the not-connected state."
      }
    }
  }
}
